\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelGuessingModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelGuessingModel}_S\\)</span> (typed guessing-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"962458a3ee31cc8f\" href=\"?note=962458a3ee31cc8f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model-guessing-model\">58-df-zfc-model-guessing-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\)</span> (equinumerosity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}internally\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(M,\\omega_1)\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModelGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta,\\omega_1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}internally\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(M,\\omega_1)\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModelGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta,\\omega_1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hereditary structure, elementary-submodel relation, approximation cardinal, and guessing witness are inherited from the canonical typed predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model-guessing-model","status":"resolved","id":"962458a3ee31cc8f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model-guessing-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$ (see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model-guessing-model","status":"resolved","id":"962458a3ee31cc8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModelGuessingModel}_S$ (typed guessing-model predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-model-guessing-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","locati